description	"Gerlon Two-Fingers

A scarred duelist who lost his fingers due to an unstable blaster pistol, forever effecting his aim, but not his ability to continue overcharging said pistol.

^2Weaponry:
- Two Fingered Melee
-- 50% Less Damage
-- Re-Open Wound (Bloody Melee)
- Overcharged Ion Pistol (DC Carbine 1)
-- 50% More Damage
-- 150% More FP Damage 
-- 100% More RoF
-- Pulses/Ignites/Stuns/Slows
-- Mag Reload
- Stun Baton (2)
- CryoBan Grenades (3)

^8Attributes:
- Tracking Beacon
- Dexterity (1)
- Slow Faller 
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (3)
- Two-Fingered Wrath (Fury 1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Two-Fingered Roll ^3[CS2]
- Overcharge (Force Rage 1) ^3[CS3]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS4 Melee]"
